      "string_id": "merc_mission2_dialog_phrase_2",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Yes. It was a pleasure working with you. You used to be special forces, right? We can talk frankly, we're all operators here so we know when someone's been a part of the \"brotherhood\".",
      "JA_current": "Yes. It was a pleasure working with you. You used to be special forces, right? We can talk frankly, we're all operators here so we know when someone's been a part of the \"brotherhood\".",
      "JA_new": "ああ。あんたと組めてよかった。元特殊部隊だろ？ 率直に話そうぜ。ここにいるのは全員、現場の人間だ。「仲間」の一員だったかどうかは分かる。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "merc_mission2_dialog",
